Before the fix it failed on: `XFP: bogus` → "bogus" (want http), `XFP: HTTP` → "HTTP" (want http), `XFProtocol: HTTPS` → "HTTPS", `XFP bogus + XUrlScheme https` → "bogus", `XUrlScheme: bogus` → "bogus". After the fix all 13 cases pass: no headers/no TLS→http; no headers+TLS→https; XFP https→https; XFP HTTP→http; XFP bogus→http; XFP bogus+XFProtocol https→https; XFP bogus+XFProtocol bogus→http; both bogus+TLS→https; XFProtocol HTTPS→https; X-Forwarded-Ssl on→https; X-Url-Scheme https→https; XFP bogus+XUrlScheme https→https; XUrlScheme bogus→http.

